{"id":53829,"date":"2025-12-29T06:15:49","date_gmt":"2025-12-29T06:15:49","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/nursesrevisionuganda.com\/?page_id=53829"},"modified":"2025-12-29T06:16:46","modified_gmt":"2025-12-29T06:16:46","slug":"privacy-policy-3","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/nursesrevisionuganda.com\/privacy-policy-3\/","title":{"rendered":"Privacy Policy"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"53829\" class=\"elementor elementor-53829\" data-elementor-settings=\"{&quot;ha_cmc_init_switcher&quot;:&quot;no&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-836ee36 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"836ee36\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_ha_eqh_enable&quot;:false}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-7287b41\" data-id=\"7287b41\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c7673cf elementor-widget elementor-widget-html\" data-id=\"c7673cf\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"html.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\r\n<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html lang=\"en\">\r\n<head>\r\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\r\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\r\n    <style>\r\n        \/* 1. CORE BRANDING *\/\r\n        :root {\r\n            --brand-deep: #3b0764;\r\n            --brand-purple: #9333ea;\r\n            --brand-light: #f5f0ff;\r\n            --text-main: #1f2937;\r\n            --text-muted: #4b5563;\r\n            --white: #ffffff;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\r\n        body { \r\n            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, sans-serif; \r\n            background-color: #fdfbff;\r\n            color: var(--text-main);\r\n            line-height: 1.6;\r\n            overflow-x: hidden;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        \/* 2. FULL-WIDTH BREAKOUT HERO *\/\r\n        .hero {\r\n            width: 100vw;\r\n            position: relative;\r\n            left: 50%;\r\n            right: 50%;\r\n            margin-left: -50vw;\r\n            margin-right: -50vw;\r\n            padding: 80px 20px;\r\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(59, 7, 100, 0.9) 0%, rgba(147, 51, 234, 0.8) 100%),\r\n                        url('https:\/\/nursesrevisionuganda.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/12\/nurses-in-an-examination-room.jpg');\r\n            background-size: cover;\r\n            background-position: center;\r\n            text-align: center;\r\n            color: var(--white);\r\n            border-bottom: 4px solid var(--brand-purple);\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .hero h1 { font-size: 34px; font-weight: 900; margin-bottom: 10px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: -1px; }\r\n        .hero p { font-size: 16px; opacity: 0.8; font-weight: 500; }\r\n\r\n        \/* 3. CONTENT STRUCTURE *\/\r\n        .container {\r\n            max-width: 850px;\r\n            margin: 0 auto;\r\n            padding: 50px 20px 100px 20px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .status-badge {\r\n            display: inline-block;\r\n            background: var(--brand-light);\r\n            color: var(--brand-purple);\r\n            padding: 5px 15px;\r\n            border-radius: 50px;\r\n            font-size: 12px;\r\n            font-weight: 800;\r\n            margin-bottom: 40px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        \/* 4. SECTION CARDS *\/\r\n        .policy-card {\r\n            background: var(--white);\r\n            padding: 30px;\r\n            border-radius: 24px;\r\n            border: 1px solid rgba(147, 51, 234, 0.1);\r\n            margin-bottom: 30px;\r\n            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(59, 7, 100, 0.03);\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .policy-card h2 {\r\n            font-size: 20px;\r\n            font-weight: 900;\r\n            color: var(--brand-deep);\r\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\r\n            display: flex;\r\n            align-items: center;\r\n            gap: 10px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .policy-card h2::before {\r\n            content: \"\";\r\n            width: 4px;\r\n            height: 20px;\r\n            background: var(--brand-purple);\r\n            border-radius: 10px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .policy-card p {\r\n            font-size: 15px;\r\n            color: var(--text-muted);\r\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .policy-card ul {\r\n            padding-left: 20px;\r\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\r\n            color: var(--text-muted);\r\n            font-size: 14.5px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .policy-card li { margin-bottom: 8px; }\r\n\r\n        \/* 5. CONTACT AREA *\/\r\n        .footer-cta {\r\n            text-align: center;\r\n            padding: 40px;\r\n            background: var(--brand-light);\r\n            border-radius: 30px;\r\n            margin-top: 50px;\r\n        }\r\n        .footer-cta a { color: var(--brand-purple); font-weight: 800; text-decoration: none; }\r\n\r\n        @media (min-width: 768px) {\r\n            .hero h1 { font-size: 52px; }\r\n            .policy-card { padding: 45px; }\r\n        }\r\n    <\/style>\r\n<\/head>\r\n<body>\r\n\r\n    <!-- HERO HEADER -->\r\n    <header class=\"hero\">\r\n        <h1>Privacy Policy<\/h1>\r\n        <p>Your data security and privacy at Nurses Revision<\/p>\r\n    <\/header>\r\n\r\n    <main class=\"container\">\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"status-badge\">Last Updated: December 29, 2025<\/div>\r\n\r\n        <section class=\"policy-card\">\r\n            <h2>Introduction<\/h2>\r\n            <p>Nurses Revision (\u201cus\u201d, \u201cwe\u201d, or \u201cour\u201d) operates the Nurses Revision website (the \u201cService\u201d).<\/p>\r\n            <p>This policy informs you of our practices regarding the collection, use, and disclosure of Personal Information when you use our Service. We are committed to protecting your privacy in accordance with the <b>Data Protection and Privacy Act of Uganda (2019).<\/b><\/p>\r\n        <\/section>\r\n\r\n        <section class=\"policy-card\">\r\n            <h2>Information Collection And Use<\/h2>\r\n            <p>While using our Service, we may ask you to provide us with certain personally identifiable information that can be used to contact or identify you. Personally identifiable information may include, but is not limited to:<\/p>\r\n            <ul>\r\n                <li>Full Name<\/li>\r\n                <li>Email address<\/li>\r\n                <li>Educational Institution (optional)<\/li>\r\n                <li>WhatsApp Phone Number (for study groups)<\/li>\r\n            <\/ul>\r\n            <p>We use this information to provide and improve the Service, notify you about academic updates, and manage your access to restricted resources.<\/p>\r\n        <\/section>\r\n\r\n        <section class=\"policy-card\">\r\n            <h2>Log Data & Analytics<\/h2>\r\n            <p>We collect information that your browser sends whenever you visit our Service (\u201cLog Data\u201d). This may include:<\/p>\r\n            <ul>\r\n                <li>Your computer\u2019s Internet Protocol (\u201cIP\u201d) address<\/li>\r\n                <li>Browser type and version<\/li>\r\n                <li>The pages of our Service that you visit<\/li>\r\n                <li>The time and date of your visit and time spent on pages<\/li>\r\n            <\/ul>\r\n        <\/section>\r\n\r\n        <section class=\"policy-card\">\r\n            <h2>Cookies<\/h2>\r\n            <p>Cookies are small files stored on your device to help improve your user experience. We use cookies to:<\/p>\r\n            <ul>\r\n                <li>Keep you logged in to your account.<\/li>\r\n                <li>Understand how you use our revision materials.<\/li>\r\n                <li>Remember your preferences for future visits.<\/li>\r\n            <\/ul>\r\n            <p>You can instruct your browser to refuse all cookies, however, some portions of our Service may not function correctly without them.<\/p>\r\n        <\/section>\r\n\r\n        <section class=\"policy-card\">\r\n            <h2>Service Providers<\/h2>\r\n            <p>We may employ third-party companies and individuals (such as hosting providers and analytics services) to facilitate our Service. These third parties have access to your Personal Information only to perform specific tasks on our behalf and are obligated not to disclose or use it for any other purpose.<\/p>\r\n        <\/section>\r\n\r\n        <!-- ADDED SECTION: DATA RETENTION -->\r\n        <section class=\"policy-card\">\r\n            <h2>Data Retention<\/h2>\r\n            <p>We will retain your Personal Information only for as long as is necessary for the purposes set out in this Privacy Policy. We will retain and use your information to the extent necessary to comply with our legal obligations and resolve academic disputes.<\/p>\r\n        <\/section>\r\n\r\n        <section class=\"policy-card\">\r\n            <h2>Security<\/h2>\r\n            <p>The security of your Personal Information is important to us. We implement commercially acceptable technical and organizational measures to protect your data. However, no method of transmission over the Internet is 100% secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.<\/p>\r\n        <\/section>\r\n\r\n        <section class=\"policy-card\">\r\n            <h2>Links To Other Sites<\/h2>\r\n            <p>Our Service contains links to other sites (e.g., UAHEB\/UNMEB portals). If you click on a third-party link, you will be directed to that site. We strongly advise you to review the Privacy Policy of every site you visit, as we have no control over their content or practices.<\/p>\r\n        <\/section>\r\n\r\n        <section class=\"policy-card\">\r\n            <h2>Children\u2019s Privacy<\/h2>\r\n            <p>Our Service is intended for students and healthcare professionals. We do not knowingly collect information from children under the age of 18. If we discover that a child under 18 has provided us with Personal Information, we will delete it from our servers immediately.<\/p>\r\n        <\/section>\r\n\r\n        <section class=\"policy-card\">\r\n            <h2>Compliance With Laws<\/h2>\r\n            <p>We will disclose your Personal Information where required to do so by law or subpoena, or if we believe that such action is necessary to comply with the law and the reasonable requests of Ugandan law enforcement.<\/p>\r\n        <\/section>\r\n\r\n        <section class=\"policy-card\">\r\n            <h2>Changes To This Privacy Policy<\/h2>\r\n            <p>We may update our Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify you of any changes by posting the new Privacy Policy on this page. You are advised to review this Privacy Policy periodically for any changes.<\/p>\r\n        <\/section>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"footer-cta\">\r\n            <h3>Contact Our Privacy Officer<\/h3>\r\n            <p>If you have questions about your data or this policy, contact us at: <br>\r\n            <a href=\"mailto:nursesrevision@gmail.com\">nursesrevision@gmail.com<\/a><\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <\/main>\r\n\r\n<\/body>\r\n<\/html>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Privacy Policy Your data security and privacy at Nurses Revision Last Updated: December 29, 2025 Introduct